(This guide describes a repeatable workflow for preparing music assets for clinician-) Tj
0 -14 Td
(approved use and digital distribution. It covers exports, stems, metadata, loudness) Tj
0 -14 Td
(measurement, and packaging. Music is a supportive resource, not a substitute for) Tj
0 -14 Td
(medical care; follow the care team's direction and the listener's preferences.) Tj
0 -14 Td
