0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(4\) Stems & stems packaging) Tj
0 -14 Td
(* Provide stems in WAV/FLAC \(e.g., vocals.wav, pads.wav, perc.wav, bass.wav\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
(* Include a stems_info.json and README describing usage, tempo \(BPM\), and suggested) Tj
0 -14 Td
(sync points.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
